  "prefLabel": "Plc 907.05 Information and Attestation Relative to Continuing Education",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 907.05 Information and Attestation Relative to Continuing Education.\n\n(a) An applicant for renewal shall provide the following information relative to continuing education:\n\n(1) The total number of hours achieved by the applicant in continuing education courses or other activities since the beginning of the current license term; and\n\n(2) The following information for each continuing education course and activity for which credit is claimed:\n\na. The name of the course or activity;\n\nb. The beginning and ending date(s) of the course or activity;\n\nc. The name of the sponsor or provider of the course or activity; and\n\nd. The total number of hours attributable to the course or activity.\n\n(b) Submission of the information shall constitute the applicant’s attestation that the applicant has met all continuing education requirements.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc900.html"
